            <listPerson>
                <person xml:id="MCC01" sex="1">
                    <persName>
                        <roleName/>
                        <forename>James</forename>
                        <surname>McCabe</surname>
                        <addName/>
                    </persName>

                    <birth when="unknown">
                        <placeName/>
                    </birth>

                    <death when="unknown"/>

                    <occupation>Tenant OR Stock Exchange worker</occupation>

                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p> There are two tentative possibilities for who McCabe is, each begining
                            with the same forename. The first James McCabe was a tenant of 13
                            Primrose Street listed there in the rate books between 1800 to 1807. The
                            second James McCabe was a stock exchange worker of the same period.
                            Neither appear elsewhere in the diaries, only being refered to in 1805
                            and 1811. </p>
                    </note>
                </person>
